    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports English subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a role-playing game about the adventures of &quot;Kim Jungbung,&quot; a game streamer active on DC Inside.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It follows a traditional JRPG style where the player engages in conversations with characters to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the sequel to <i>\u201cJungbung\u2019s Adventure on DC Inside\u201d</i>, continuing from the first installment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After many twists and turns, Kim Jungbung finally becomes a retro game master\u2014<br>but now, he's on the verge of losing his job due to the low popularity of his game streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kim Jungbung be able to overcome this crisis and keep his title as a retro game master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s join the journey and fight through the struggles of an ordinary young man!</p>",
